Package: guesthouse-gnome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Guesthouse contributors <144541403+s3k000@users.noreply.github.com>
Conflicts: guesthouse-plasma
Depends: guesthouse-desktop (= @VERSION@), gdm3, ubuntu-session, ubuntu-desktop-minimal, dconf-cli, ptyxis, gnome-text-editor, gnome-control-center, fonts-ubuntu, yaru-theme-gtk, yaru-theme-icon
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Description: Guesthouse: Ubuntu's GNOME desktop on the Mac's graphics device
 GNOME Shell (Ubuntu's session) in place of weston, through our Mesa (Zink on
 KosmicKrisp), signed in at boot by GDM as the account the install made, at
 the scale and with the keyboard layout the Mac app gives. Removing this package
 gives the weston desktop back.
